              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu muhiga gwa komi na mbili gwi liamiiha lia Joramu muyaayi wa Ahabu kuli mwami wa Isiraeli, Ahazia muyaayi wa Jehoramu yagwa mwami wi Ivuyuda ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "naveeye ni mihiga sirini na mbili, na yamiha mu Jerusalemi ku muhiga mulala. Mama weve yaali Azalia mukaana wu Mwami Ahabu mwisukulu wa Omuri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kigira Ahazia yaali mwiko wu mwami Ahabu ku lileeta mukaana weve, yoona imbiri, wa Yahova kuli avinyumba ya Ahabu vakora.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.27"
            ]
          }
        }
