            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwami Jehoramu yirana mu lidaala linene lia Jezireeli kulwalizwa mbula ahone zing'oma zia Vasiria vamwaatira ha Rama, lwa yalwana na Hazaeli mwami wa Siria. Ahazia muyaayi wa Jehoramu mwami wi Ivuyuda yasulunguta yo kuzia ku muloraa kigira yaali mulwaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.29",
